kernora-desktop (1.4.3) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * The greeter names the sessions Kernora and Kernora (X11) instead of
    Plasma.
  * Crashes no longer open KDE's crash reporter: a drop-in replaces
    drkonqi-coredump-launcher with kernora-crash-notifier, which shows a
    short notification for apps that have a launcher entry.
  * The installer removes the live session's /etc/xdg/kwalletrc.

