kernora-desktop (1.2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Material 3 design system generated from one seed colour: an HCT colour
    engine, KDE colour schemes, QML design tokens and system defaults.
  * Kernora Plasma theme: floating pill panel, popups, tooltips, task
    buttons, lists and sliders drawn from the Material tokens.
  * Kernora icon theme drawn from vendored Material Symbols Rounded.
  * Kernora Launcher: application menu with search, pinned apps and session
    actions.
  * Kernora Quick Settings: status area and a quick settings shade that is
    pulled up from the panel and follows the pointer, with Material sliders
    and toggle tiles.
  * New default layout: one floating panel with centred tasks.
  * Russian translations of the shell.

